---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Start a Project | Couch & Craft"
noindex: true
cta: false
crumb: "Start a project"
---
<section class="band start" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
  <div class="container start__inner">
    <div class="flow start__aside">
      <h1 id="page-heading">Start a project</h1>
      <p class="lead">Tell me a bit about your business.{% if site.contact.responseTime | isSet %} I'll reply within {{ site.contact.responseTime }}.{% else %} I'll reply within {{ site.contact.responseTime | open }}.{% endif %}</p>
      <h2 class="start__subhead">What happens next</h2>
      <ol class="next-steps">
        <li>I read what you sent and look at your current site, if you have one.</li>
        <li>I reply with a couple of questions or a time for a 30-minute call.</li>
        <li>On the call, we figure out if a new site makes sense. If it doesn't, I'll tell you.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="start__call">Rather call? {% set kind = "phone" %}{% set location = "start" %}{% include "partials/contact-link.njk" %}</p>
    </div>
    {% set form = { id: "start-form", type: "project", submitLabel: "Send it to Justin" } %}
    {% include "partials/form.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
